    "Name": "Crab",
    "Details": "This <i>Crab</i> has been modified to such an extent that whichever original designation it had is now meaningless. Known only by the bloodname of its pilot, \"Hallis\", this ancient war machine carries with it early examples of Clan weapons technology.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
